  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Investment Funds (CIFs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The $8 billion Climate Investment Funds (CIF) accelerates climate action by empowering transformations in clean technology, energy access, climate resilience, and sustainable forests in developing and middle income countries. The CIF&#x2019;s large-scale, low-cost, long-term financing lowers the risk and cost of climate financing. It tests new business models, builds track records in unproven markets, and boosts investor confidence to unlock additional sources of finance.</narrative>
  </description>
